     "transcription": "$4 \\sin^2\\left(\\dfrac{\\text{distantiae}}{2}\\right) = 2 \\sin\\left(\\dfrac{L - L'}{2}\\right) \\dfrac{\\cos\\text{β}}{R} \\times 2 \\sin\\left(\\dfrac{L - L'}{2}\\right) \\dfrac{\\cos\\text{β}'}{R} + 4 \\sin^2\\left(\\dfrac{\\text{β} - \\text{β}'}{2}\\right)$.",
